<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-NATAL 116-3 AGAINST TRANSVAAL AT LUNCH.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-NATAL 116-3 AGAINST TRANSVAAL AT LUNCH.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Natal were 116 for three from 31 overs at lunch in their four-day Supersport Series match against Transvaal in Johannesburg on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Natal 116-3 from 31 overs against Transvaal.</p>
